  "bio": "Experience the art of ink at Tom's Tattoo & Piercing Studio, nestled in the vibrant heart of Ottobrunn, Germany. Specializing in striking black and gray as well as intricate dotwork tattoos, Tom's studio is your go-to destination for bespoke body art and expert cover-ups. Book your appointment today and bring your unique tattoo vision to life in an environment where creativity meets precision.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Ottobrunn, Bavaria, Germany"
